## Bot.ts Specific Commands

You can use the `bot.ts` CLI commands to manage your project or use the package manager scripts. Here are some of the most useful commands:

- **Add a new command**:
  ```bash
  # Recommended (runs the locally installed package)
  <%- resolveCommand("{exec} @ghom/bot.ts-cli add command") %>

  # Alternative (if the "bot" command is globally installed or in your PATH)
  bot add command
  ```
- **Add other components** (buttons, listeners, slash commands, tables, etc.):
  ```bash
  # Recommended (runs the locally installed package)
  <%- resolveCommand("{exec} @ghom/bot.ts-cli add <component-type>") %>

  # Alternative (if the "bot" command is globally installed or in your PATH)
  bot add <component-type>
  ```
  *(Component types: `slash`, `command`, `button`, `listener`, `cron`, `namespace`, `table`)*
- **Update the framework**:
  ```bash
  <%- resolveCommand("{run} update") %>
  ```
- **Regenerate this README**:
  ```bash
  <%- resolveCommand("{run} readme") %>
  ```

